{"id":"33ca2a2b879f60f7","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-canonical-wellorder.md","title":"ZFC Canonical Wellorder","display":"df-zfc-canonical-wellorder — ZFC Canonical Wellorder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-canonical-wellorder","aliases":["58-df-zfc-canonical-wellorder"],"display":"df-zfc-canonical-wellorder — ZFC Canonical Wellorder","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-well-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-canonical-wellorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-canonical-wellorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-canonical-wellorder — ZFC Canonical Wellorder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-well-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,X,\\prec,\\mathsf W_X\\in V\">\\(R,X,\\prec,\\mathsf W_X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-well-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalWellorder}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalWellorder}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}wellorder}\\vdash\\mathrm{CanonicalWellorder}_S(R,X,\\prec)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathsf W_X\\;\\left(\\mathsf W_X=\\{S\\subseteq X\\times X:\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,S)\\}\\land\\operatorname{WellOrder}(\\mathsf W_X,\\prec)\\land R\\in\\mathsf W_X\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathsf W_X\\;\\bigl(R=S\\lor\\langle R,S\\rangle\\in\\prec\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}wellorder}\\vdash\\mathrm{CanonicalWellorder}_S(R,X,\\prec)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathsf W_X\\;\\left(\\mathsf W_X=\\{S\\subseteq X\\times X:\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,S)\\}\\land\\operatorname{WellOrder}(\\mathsf W_X,\\prec)\\land R\\in\\mathsf W_X\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathsf W_X\\;\\bigl(R=S\\lor\\langle R,S\\rangle\\in\\prec\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Canonical” is relative to the supplied well-order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> of the relation codes. ZFC proves that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> can be well-ordered, but does not by itself select a parameter-free canonical well-order for every set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-well-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WellOrder}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-well-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,X,\\prec,\\mathsf W_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WellOrder}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CanonicalWellorder}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}wellorder}\\vdash\\mathrm{CanonicalWellorder}_S(R,X,\\prec)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathsf W_X\\;\\left(\\mathsf W_X=\\{S\\subseteq X\\times X:\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,S)\\}\\land\\operatorname{WellOrder}(\\mathsf W_X,\\prec)\\land R\\in\\mathsf W_X\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathsf W_X\\;\\bigl(R=S\\lor\\langle R,S\\rangle\\in\\prec\\bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1122,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1475","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-canonical-wellorder.md|58-df-zfc-canonical-wellorder]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["1d0b2b70d1c22cc7"]}